The result should still feel distinctly **Mupezeni: African retail, warm terracotta, editorial design, real business workflows and practical AI.** Not a generic futuristic AI template. [LEANSpark](https://leanspark.ai/)

One important rule before we begin: **we must not invent statistics about Zambian retailers, customer volumes, hours lost or business results.** Instead, we'll make the problem quantifiable with an interactive calculator, demonstrate the workflow using clearly labelled sample data, and add verified customer evidence as we collect it.

